---
description: ZashDine module conventions
globs: modules/ZashDine/**
alwaysApply: false
---
- Load .agents/skills/create-nexopos-module/SKILL.md before editing the module.
- Namespace Modules\ZashDine, route prefix zash-dine, permissions zash.dine.*, tables zash_dine_*.
- Every migration needs a working down(). Verify with migrate:rollback.
- Do not edit core files outside modules/ZashDine unless unavoidable; explain why in the PR.
- Kitchen status changes run in a DB transaction with locking. Reverb events are never the only source of truth; provide a polling fallback.
- Tests only for risky logic: routing by category, concurrent status updates, permissions.
- After changes update docs/zashpos/ZASHDINE.md and CHANGELOG.md.
